  sub:quote a prov:Entity ;
    schema:text "It ascribes to a mechanical cause a curious peculiarity of form; it shews, by reference to this mechanical principle, that two conditions which were very different to the systematic naturalist’s eye, were really only two simple mechanical modifications of the same thing; and it destroys the chief evidence for the existence of a supposed new species of worm" ;
    prov:wasQuotedFrom <https://www.gutenberg.org/ebooks/55264> ;
